EXTEND_BOTTOM PLAYER1 7
IF ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)
IsValidForPartyDialogue("KKNavar")~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal1
END

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal1
~What's wrong, love? You do not look well.~
END
++ ~I... I do not know, I feel...~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKEndangerNavarra","GLOBAL",1)~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal1.control
++ ~No, no! Stay back, you've got to...~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKEndangerNavarra","GLOBAL",1)~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal1.control
++ ~Run Navarra! Please! Get away from me!~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKEndangerNavarra","GLOBAL",1)~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal1.control

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal1.control
~What are you trying to say, <CHARNAME>? Speak up, love... why do you have such a strange look on your....oh no. Not again!~
DO ~ActionOverride(Player1,ReallyForceSpell(Myself,SLAYER_CHANGE))~
EXIT

EXTEND_BOTTOM PLAYER1 10
IF ~Global("KKEndangerNavarra","GLOBAL",1) !Detect("KKNavar")~ DO ~SetGlobal("DrowTalk","GLOBAL",5)~ GOTO 12
IF ~Global("KKEndangerNavarra","GLOBAL",1) Detect("KKNavar")~ DO ~SetGlobal("DrowTalk","GLOBAL",5)~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2
END

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2
~Well, this cannot be a good rhink. Can't say I'm fond of the new look, either.~
END
++ ~I do not think I've ever been so scared in my life...~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2.2
++ ~Sure, I'm scared to death and you are making jokes. Is that your way of telling me you can't handle it? Because I need you now more than ever.~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2.3
++ ~I felt so powerful! I wonder if I can learn to control that, harness it when I want to.~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2.4

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2.2
~(Navarra wraps her arms arm around you tightly)~
~It's over now. I have to admit, it scared me, too. We need to find Irenicus and soon. I'm going to enjoy tearing him a part, piece by piece!~
EXIT

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2.3
~I'm sorry, I'm afraid too, you know. You should know by now I'll never abandon you. I love you, <CHARNAME>. We need to find Irenicus quickly, however, before something worse happens to you.~
EXIT

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarBhaal2.4
~You can't possibly mean that, you are starting to scare me. You must see that using this... power... it is evil..  Let's go get your soul back, before anything worse happens to you.~
EXIT

INTERJECT Player1 3 KKNavarSpellholdDizzy0
== KKNavJ IF ~InParty("KKNavar") Range("KKNavar",15) !StateCheck("KKNavar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)~ THEN ~Easy there, <CHARNAME>. Are you ill? Maybe you should stop and rest a bit.~
END
++ ~I felt dizzy for a moment. Nothing to worry about, it is over now.~  EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy2
++ ~I seemed to have lost control of myself for a minute, I'm fine now though, thanks.~   EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy1
++ ~I'm...not sure. I felt myself slipping, losing control.~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy1
++ ~I'm fine Navarra, thanks for asking.~  EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy2

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy1
~No one will fault you for stopping and resting a while, you've been through quite an ordeal.~
EXIT

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy2
 ~If you are sure. Our chances of getting out of here in one piece aren't too great, if you can't even walk.~
EXIT

INTERJECT Player1 3 KKNavarSpellholdDizzy3
== KKNavJ IF ~InParty("KKNavar") Range("KKNavar",15) !StateCheck("KKNavar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID) Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN ~(Navarra puts his arm around your waist for fear you'll fall) What's wrong, love? You look pale.~
END
++ ~I felt dizzy for a moment. I do not know what came over me.~  EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy4
++ ~I seemed to have lost control of myself for a minute. I'm very glad you are here, that was a bit unnerving.~   EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy5
++ ~I'm...not sure. I felt myself slipping, losing control. I have to admit it scared me a little.~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy5
++ ~I'm fine Navarra, thanks for asking.~  EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy4

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy4
~You really should stop and rest. you are going to need all your strength.~
EXIT

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy5
~I'm going to make Irenicus deeply regret ever hurting you.~
EXIT

INTERJECT Player1 3 KKNavarSpellholdDizzy6
== KKNavJ IF ~InParty("KKNavar") Range("KKNavar",15) !StateCheck("KKNavar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID) Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ THEN ~What's wrong, <CHARNAME>? Y look a bit pale. Here, take my arm unyil you are steady.~
END
++ ~I felt dizzy for a moment. I do not know what came over me.~  EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy7
++ ~I seemed to have lost control of myself for a minute. I'm very glad you are here, that was a bit unnerving.~   EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy8
++ ~I'm...not sure. I felt myself slipping, losing control. I have to admit, it scared me a little.~ EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy8
++ ~I'm fine Navarra, thanks for asking.~  EXTERN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy7

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy7
~You really should stop and rest. I'm here for you, if you need me.~
EXIT

CHAIN KKNavJ KKNavarSpellholdDizzy8
~This can't be a good thing. Please, if you need anything at all... I'm here for you.~
EXIT

INTERJECT PLAYER1 33 TreeofLifeVariableForNavarra
== PLAYER1 IF ~IsValidForPartyDialog("KKNavar")~ THEN ~(You turn to Navarra, the fiery barbarian who has remained by your side from the beginning, can you ask her to risk her life yet again?)~
END
++ ~Navarra, there is no reason for you to risk your life and follow me where I must go now. You have seen how powerful Irenicus is, I won't blame you if you choose to go home.~ EXTERN KKNavJ Option1
++ ~Navarra, I need to know if you ready for this. You won't abandon me now will you?~ EXTERN KKNavJ Option2
IF ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN REPLY ~Navarra, I....~ EXTERN KKNavJ Option3
++ ~Navarra, you've done so much for me already...You can still walk away. There is a chance you could die and I can't make you take that risk.~ EXTERN KKNavJ Option4
IF ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3)~ THEN REPLY ~Navarra, there is no reason for you to risk your life and follow me where I must go now. You have seen how powerful Irenicus is, I won't blame you if you choose to go home.~ EXTERN KKNavJ Option5

APPEND KKNAVJ

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN Option1
SAY ~There is every reason for me to follow you, <CHARNAME>. You have been a good friend, and I will gladly risk my life to see your soul returned to you.~ COPY_TRANS PLAYER1 33
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN Option2
SAY ~I won't abandon you, <CHARNAME>. That monster is in possession of your soul, and I'll help you no matter what happens.~ COPY_TRANS PLAYER1 33
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN Option3
SAY ~No, my love, I refuse to leave your side. I love you,<CHARNAME>, and we haven't come this far together, just to have me walk away now. We will get your soul back, and I will take pleasure in making that monster suffer for ever hurting you.~ COPY_TRANS PLAYER1 33
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN Option4
SAY ~You do not need to even ask me that, <CHARNAME>. For me to walk away, knowing your soul is gone, would be wrong.~ COPY_TRANS PLAYER1 33
END

IF ~~ THEN BEGIN Option5
SAY ~There is every reason for me to follow you, <CHARNAME>. Things may not have turned out the way I had hoped between us, but you have been a good friend, and I will gladly risk my life to see your soul returned to you.~ COPY_TRANS PLAYER1 33
END

IF ~Global("KKNThief","LOCALS",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKNF
SAY ~Is every city over-run with thieves?~
++ ~Pretty much. It is easy for them to operate and control a city.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNThief","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNFa
++ ~From what I've seen, yes. People are afraid to stand up to them.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNThief","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNFe
++ ~You seem surprised, never spent much time in a city before?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNThief","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNFf
+ ~CLASS(Player1,THIEF_ALL)~ + ~Of course, we always operate in cities, there's a lot of money to be made. Especially with the slave trade.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNThief","LOCALS",2)~  + KKNFf
++ ~That's to be expected, now let's go.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNThief","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNFa
SAY ~I cannot imagine it would be that easy with all the guards around.~
++ ~Not all guards are honest. A simple bribe, on a regular basis, is all it takes for them to look the other way.~ + KKNFb
++ ~Perhaps they fear a dagger in their back, and choose to ignore them.~ + KKNFc
++ ~It is easier than you think. I am sure most of their business is conducted at night.~ + KKNFd
++ ~I really would not know, nor do I care.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNFb
SAY ~Obviously all the guards are male, females have more honor and would never allow such a thing.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNFc
SAY ~I suppose you are right. Still, those deviants should not be allowed to cause such fear.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNFd
SAY ~True, though hiding in the shadows is for cowards.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNFe
SAY ~I suppose I can understand that. These people seem incapable of a confrontation on the scale needed to put an end to them.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNFf
SAY ~No, I have not. On my journey here, I chose to make camp rather than enter a city.~
= ~Now I am very glad I did.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNFg
SAY ~I may not agree with the actions of thieves, but I agree that everyone needs access to slaves.~
= ~I still need to replace mine.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKNHorseTalk","LOCALS",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKHT
SAY ~How is it that everyone is happy to just walk everywhere! I have not seen even one horse.~ 
++ ~Because there are no horses here. You cannot miss what you've never had.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNHorseTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKHTa
++ ~Why would not they? It is a fine day today, perfect for a nice walk.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNHorseTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKHTe
++ ~Great more whining, are you ever happy?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNHorseTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKHTf
++ ~We do not have time for this, I have things to do.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNHorseTalk","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKHTa
SAY ~Perhaps it is just because we are in the city. I can only hope we find some elsewhere. I cannot imagine not being able to replace the one I had.~
+ ~Gender(Player1,MALE)~ + ~Too good to walk, or are you so spoiled that you will not be able to keep up?~ + KKHTb
++ ~I am sure you will be fine. Walking is good for you.~ + KKHTc
++ ~We can stop and rest if you are tired.~ + KKHTd
++ ~You can walk just like the rest of us. Do try to keep up.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKHTb
SAY ~I am quite capable of walking, and you should be careful of how you speak to me.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END 

IF ~~ THEN KKHTc
SAY ~I do not mind walking, but riding is much more pleasurable.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END 

IF ~~ THEN KKHTd
SAY ~I am fine, I just miss my horse.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKHTe
SAY ~Yes, it is. I am just not used to being somewhere where there aren't any.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKHTf
SAY ~We can talk later, if your sour mood improves.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKNUmar","LOCALS",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKNU
SAY ~It is so beautiful here. It is amazing how the land flourishs, when it isnt frozen solid.~
+ ~Class(Player1,RANGER)~ + ~There is nothing more peaceful or wonderous as the forest.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNUmar","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNUa
++ ~It is nice, I suppose.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNUmar","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNUb
++ ~Is Narfell really that bad? is there no warmth at all?~ + KKNUc
+ ~Class(Player1,THIEF)~ + ~Too much nature for me, I prefer the city.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNUmar","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNUd
++ ~Whatever, let's go.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNUmar","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNUa
SAY ~I can see why you chose to be a ranger.~
++ ~Is Narfell really that bad? is there no warmth at all?~ + KKNUc
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUh
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUi
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUj
+ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUk
++ ~Indeed, shall we catch up with the others now?~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNUb
SAY ~Nice? Well, it is not for everyone I guess.~
++ ~Sorry, I just prefer the city.~ + KKNUe
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUh
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUi
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUj
+ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUk
++ ~True enough. Let's go.~ EXIT
END


IF ~~ THEN KKNUc
SAY ~Certainly. The spring is quite pretty, watching the land come alive.~ 
= ~It is not always frigid, but it definitely does not look like this.~
+ ~Class(Player1,RANGER)~ + ~I know what you mean, it is a sight to behold.~ + KKNUf
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUh
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUi
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUj
+ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUk
++ ~Even so, I would much rather be in the city.~ + KKNUe
++ ~Sounds nice, but we should get going.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNUd
SAY ~Of course, that is understandable. Still, it is a nice change.~
++ ~Yes, it is. For a visit, but I would not care to live here.~ + KKNUg
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUh
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUi
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUj
+ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUk
++ ~True, but we should get going.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNUe
SAY ~We all have our preferences. I grew up in open spaces, so to me this paradise.~
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Makes sense. Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUh
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Makes sense. Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUi
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Makes sense. Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUj
+ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Makes sense. Could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUk
++ ~Is Narfell really that bad? is there no warmth at all?~ + KKNUc
++ ~True, but we should get going.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNUf
SAY ~That it is, I am glad to have met someone who appreciates it as much as I do.~
+ ~!Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~I am glad to have met you as well. I wonder, could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUh
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~I am glad to have met you as well. I wonder, could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUi
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I am glad to have met you as well. I wonder, could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUj
+ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I am glad to have met you as well. I wonder, could you see yourself living here?~ + KKNUk
++ ~The feeling is mutual. We have much to do, however, let's go.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNUg
SAY ~That is a shame, but I understand.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END 

IF ~~ THEN KKNUh
SAY ~I am unsure, but my first priority is to complete my mission.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END 

IF ~~ THEN KKNUi
SAY ~Perhaps, but my first priority is to complete my mission.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END 

IF ~~ THEN KKNUj
SAY ~I know I could, as long as I am with you.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END 

IF ~~ THEN KKNUk
SAY ~Edwin and I have not discussed it yet.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END 

IF ~Global("KKNavarDrow","LOCALS",1)~ THEN BEGIN KKNavDROW
SAY ~I am not sure how I feel about this.~
++ ~Neither do I, but we will have to make the best of it.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarDrow","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNavDROWa
++ ~It could be worse, If it makes you feel any better, I think you look beautiful.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarDrow","LOCALS",2)~ + KKNavDROWg
++ ~Please, Navarra, keep your voice down. We cannot afford to be discovered.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarDrow","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWa
SAY ~I agree, the last thing we need is to be discovered in the city. It does not mean, however, that I have to like it.~
++ ~That would be very dangerous. I doubt we would make it out in one piece.~ + KKNavDROWb
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I am glad you agree. Besides, we could visit the lust chambers while we are here.~ + KKNavDROWd
++ ~It could be worse, If it makes you feel any better, I think you look beautiful.~ + KKNavDROWg
++ ~I am glad you see how serious this is. Now please stop talking, the sooner we get this over with the better.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWb
SAY ~We will make it out without incident, I promise you. We just have to act like we belong there.~
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Well, we could visit the lust chambers while we are here.~ + KKNavDROWd
++ ~I suppose that means you get to order me around and I cannot argue about it.~ + KKNavDROWe
++ ~I am sure we will. But I wonder if there is something for males to do besides be slaves.~ + KKNavDROWf
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWc
SAY ~Well now, there's an offer I can't refuse. I look forward to it with great anticipation, my lady.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWd
SAY ~I have not heard of it. I cannot wait to experience it with you. my love.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWe
SAY ~I had not thought of that. This should be fun, provided I can do it now that I love you.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWf
SAY ~I hope so, I am uncertain if I can treat you as such.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWg
SAY ~I have to admit, you look rather handsome in that form. It may difficult for me to keep my hands off you.~
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Hold that thought, unless we visit the lust chambers.~ + KKNavDROWc
++ ~I suggest you restrain yourself, I cannot have you acting like that in front of anyone and risk getting us caught.~ + KKNavDROWh
++ ~I suggest you find a way to make sure you keep your hands to yourself.~ + KKNavDROWi
++ ~Let us get this over with, shall we?~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWh
SAY ~Since you put it that way, I promise to be on my best behavior.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNavDROWi
SAY ~I am perfectly capable of doing just that.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT
END

IF WEIGHT #-1 ~Global("KKDeadWarriors","LOCALS",0)~ THEN KKDW1
SAY ~I...it should not have come to that.~ 
++ ~I am sorry it turned out that way, but they left you no choice.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKDeadWarriors","LOCALS",1)~ + KKDW1a
++ ~Power and greed drive people to do terrible things, if they let it. It wasn't your fault.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKDeadWarriors","LOCALS",1)~ + KKDW1a
++ ~I agree, but at least you got the sword back.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKDeadWarriors","LOCALS",1)~ + KKDW1a
+ ~Alignment(Player1,MASK_EVIL)~ + ~You are a barbarian, you should be used to killing. Celebrate your victory, not mourn the deaths of enemies who deserved to die.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKDeadWarriors","LOCALS",1)~ + KKDW1t
END

IF ~~ KKDW1a
SAY ~I know, though it makes their deaths no easier to accept.~ 
IF ~~ THEN + KKDW1b
END

IF ~~ KKDW1b
SAY ~I want to thank you for what you did. Because of Shaelah and Tressa's betrayal...~
= ~I could not have done it without you and I appreciate it.~
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I would do just about anything for you, you know that.~ + KKDW1h
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I love you, Navarra, I was not going to let you face this alone.~ + KKDW1c
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~There is no need to thank me, I told you I would help you.~ + KKDW1i
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3)~ + ~You are welcome. It was the least I could do for all the help you have given me.~ + KKDW1o
+ ~Global("KKNavarMFriendActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~There is no need to thank me, I told you I would help you.~ + KKDW1o
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3)~ + ~You are welcome. It was the least I could do for all the help you have given me.~ + KKDW1q
+ ~Global("KKNavarFFriendActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~That is what friends do, they help eachother.~ + KKDW1q
END

IF ~~ KKDW1c
SAY ~I know, and I love you too. It is sad that Amana's love for me was a lie. It would have prevented her from betraying me, and our tribe.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKDW1d
END

IF ~~ KKDW1d
SAY ~Amana was...my sister and Chieftain Osarena is our birth mother.~ 
= ~Amana was consumed by jealousy and rage because I am to become the next Chieftain of our tribe, I just never realized it angered her until she stole the sword.~
++ ~Does that mean you are going to leave now? I know you are suppose to return the sword but I had hoped...~ + KKDW1e
++ ~So that means your destiny lies in Narfell and you need to go back.~ + KKDW1e
++ ~Dare I hope that you have another sister who can take your place as the future Chieftain?~ + KKDW1f
++ ~I do not want to lose you, but I will not stand in your way if you need to go.~ + KKDW1e
END

IF ~~ KKDW1e
SAY ~I know it is my duty to return, but I cannot. Not yet anyway... I love you too much to ever leave your side.~
= ~Unless you want me to go...~
++ ~Of course not, I do not want you to ever leave.~ + KKDW1l
++ ~You are right, Navarra, it is your duty and your destiny. You have to go back, I can finish this without you.~ + KKDW1n
END

IF ~~ KKDW1f
SAY ~No, I have no other sisters. And I know it is my duty to return, but I cannot. Not yet anyway...unless you agree to go with me when all of this is over.~ 
= ~We can return her sword and she will have to choose another to take her place, if you do not wish to stay. I love you too much to ever leave your side.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSword","GLOBAL",1)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKDW1g
SAY ~There is every need, my love. You are the only one who did not deceive and betray me...the only one who claimed to love and meant it.~
= ~Amana may have meant it once, but no longer...~ 
IF ~~ THEN + KKDW1d
END

IF ~~ KKDW1h
SAY ~I do know that, and I love you even more for it. I just wish Amana had still felt that way, she would still be alive.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKDW1d
END

IF ~~ KKDW1i
SAY ~There is every need. I was too trusting to suspect Shaelah and Tressa of betrayal. And I never thought Amana would actually try to kill someone she claimed to love and care about.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKDW1j
END

IF ~~ KKDW1j
SAY ~Amana was...my sister and Chieftain Osarena is our mother.~ 
= ~Amana was consumed by jealousy and rage, because I am to become the next Chieftain of our tribe. I just never realized it angered her until, she stole the sword.~
++ ~Does that mean you are going to leave now?~ + KKDW1k
++ ~So that means your destiny lies in Narfell and you need to go back.~ + KKDW1k
END

IF ~~ KKDW1k
SAY ~I know it is my duty to return, but I cannot. Not yet anyway...I have come to care about you and would rather stay and see this through with you.~
= ~Unless you want me to go...~
++ ~No, I want you stay! I was afraid that you did not have any feelings for me and would leave. Knowing that you do, makes me very happy.~ + KKDW1l
++ ~You are right, Navarra, it is your duty and your destiny. You have to go back, I can finish this without you.~ + KKDW1m
END

IF ~~ KKDW1l
SAY ~Then I shall stay. Maybe when this is over, we can go to Narfell together and return the sword.~ 
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSword","GLOBAL",1)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKDW1m
SAY ~If that is your wish, I will go.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKDW1n
SAY ~I cannot believe I was foolish enough to trust a man, much less give my heart to one! You are a vile creature and I am glad to be rid of you!~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKDW1o
SAY ~I know it is my duty to return, but I cannot. Not yet anyway...You are my friend and I owe you a great deal.~ 
= ~I would rather stay and see this through with you. Unless you want me to go...~
++ ~Of course not, I was hoping you would stay.~ + KKDW1p
++ ~You are right, Navarra, it is your duty and your destiny. You have to go back, I can finish this without you.~ + KKDW1m
END

IF ~~ KKDW1p
SAY ~Then I will stay and help you. But I must return to Narfell when it is over.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSword","GLOBAL",1)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKDW1q
SAY ~That was the plan, you knew that from the start.~
++ ~True, but I was hoping you would change your mind and help me until all of this is over.~ + KKDW1p
++ ~Yes I did, and you should go back. It is your duty and your destiny, I can finish this without you.~ + KKDW1r
END

IF ~~ KKDW1r
SAY ~If that is your wish, I will go.~
IF ~~ THEN DO ~LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~  EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKDW1t
SAY ~Regardless of they did, they did not deserve to die.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavSword","GLOBAL",1)~ EXIT
END

IF ~ReputationLT(Player1,7) Gender(Player1,MALE) Global("KKBadMale","LOCALS",0)~ THEN BEGIN badrep
SAY ~You have proven that men should be beaten and kept in chains. There is no honor in your behavior.~
= ~I wish you luck, you will need it.~ 
IF ~~ THEN DO ~SetGlobal("KKBadMale","LOCALS",1) LeaveParty()EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN BEGIN LT1
SAY ~You, sla...uh male, do you know where your friend was taken?~
++ ~You'll find me easier to get along with if you call me by my name, instead of insulting me.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",3) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT1a
++ ~You do not really expect me to answer you when you speak to me that way, I hope.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",3) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT1f
++ ~Ask me later. When, or if you develop some manners.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",3) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1a
SAY ~I am not interested in knowing your name, only the answer to my question. It is bad enough that I must lower myself to even speak you in the first place.~
++ ~Things are different here than where you are from. Men are treated as equals and deserve the same respect.~ + LT1b
++ ~You are making this arrangement more difficult than it has to be. We agreed to help eachother, so we need to at least try to be civil.~ + LT1c
++ ~In that case, I see no reason for us to attempt to work together. I get the feeling I will end up with a knife in my back when I am asleep.~ + LT1d
++ ~I am not interested in answering.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1b
SAY ~While I agree that things are different here, I have seen no proof that men are equals. Nor do I have any respect for them, to do so would be that I saw them as something other than slaves.~
= ~And I do not.~
++ ~You are going to have to try to see things differently. If you pay attention to what goes on around you, you will see there is good in everyone.~ + LT1c
++ ~If this mission you are on is as important as you say, maybe you can give me a chance to prove that I am not as bad as you think.~ + LT1e
++ ~Well then, I guess we're done talking.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1c
SAY ~You say that as if it is an easy thing to do. My people have lived this way for many generations and it has worked out very well.~
= ~Other than a slave, I know no other way to treat a male.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1d
SAY ~Only a coward would do such a thing. A warrior, such as myself, would rather face her opponent to watch the life drain from their eyes as they die.~
= ~Besides, I only kill those who give me no choice. So far, your only fault is being male.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1e
SAY ~My mission is of the utmost importance, I cannot go home until I complete it. So, if you are so determined to be given a chance, keep this in mind..~
= ~Respect is not freely given, it is something that must be earned.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1f
SAY ~Of course I expect an answer, I did not ask a question just to hear myself talk.~
++ ~Do you treat everyone you meet with such hostility?~ + LT1g
++ ~If this mission you are on is as important and you say, maybe this once you can make an exception and give me a chance to prove I am not as bad as you think.~ + LT1e
++ ~Do us a both a favor and be quiet.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1g
SAY ~I treat every male the same way, my people have lived this way for many generations and it has worked out very well.~
= ~Other than a slave, I know no other way to treat you.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT1h
SAY ~Nonsense. Men exist to serve, there is no other purpose for them.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",4)~ THEN BEGIN LT2
SAY ~Tell me your name.~
++ ~That's how you ask me?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",5) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT2a
++ ~Say please.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",5) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT2b
++ ~I thought you were not interested in knowing my name.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",5) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT2b
++ ~I changed my mind, I have no interest in telling you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",5) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT2b
++ ~No. Stop talking to me or go away.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",5) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~  EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT2a
SAY ~I gave what you said some thought, and though I do not agree with most of it, you do have a point. For the sake of both our missions, some civility is necessary.~
++ ~I am glad you finally agree. Now, if you ask me nicely instead of ordering me to, I will tell you what my name is.~ + LT2b
++ ~It is a start, I suppose. My name is <CHARNAME>, and you are?~ + LT2i
++ ~I will tell you mine if you tell me yours.~ + LT2k
++ ~I do not really care who you are as long as you do what you are told.~ + LT2s
++ ~I do not have time for this right now.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT2b
SAY ~You want me to be civil and yet you provoke me? I will not beg, especially to a man.~
++ ~I am not asking you to beg, just for a little consideration. Is being nice that hard for you?~ + LT2c
++ ~I give up, being nice must be an unknown concept to you. My name is <CHARNAME>, and I would prefer you call me that than slave or male. Think you can manage that?~ + LT2l
++ ~You are the most infuriating woman I have ever met! Just forget I said anything, we do not need to be on a first name basis.~ + LT2m
++ ~Have it your way, I really do not care anymore.~  EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT2c
SAY ~I am being civil and that should be enough for you. You cannot expect me to treat you as I would another female, even if I wanted to.~ 
IF ~~ THEN + LT2j
END

IF ~~ LT2d
