++ ~Are we back to this again? I thought we agreed to be nice.~ + LT3j
++ ~Gender does not make us any better or any worse than anyone else, Navarra. Is it so hard for you to keep an open mind and give me or any other man a chance to prove that you are wrong? Or is it that you are afraid that you might discover I am right?~ + LT3e
++ ~I am beginning to think there is no hope for you.~ EXIT
END

