IF ~~ LT3k
SAY ~Of course I believe that. They scurry about with no other purpose but to please their master, that is the way it has always been. They are inferior creatures who cannot string two thoughts together on their own.~
= ~Their purpose is to serve and obey, nothing else. And they accept their place within the tribe.~
++ ~Gender does not make us any better or any worse than anyone else, Navarra. Is it so hard for you to keep an open mind and give me or any other man a chance to prove that you are wrong? Or is it that you are afraid that you might discover I am right?~ + LT3e
++ ~That is horrible and cruel to treat them like that. They are people, not animals.~ + LT3l
