++ ~You have a point. It is not for me to judge how you live, even if I do not agree with it. All I ask is that you keep an open mind and give me or any other man a chance to prove that you are wrong? Or is it that you are afraid that you might discover I am right?~ + LT3e
++ ~This is a subject that we will never agree on. I just hope you come to see that's it is wrong and men deserve to be treated as equals.~ + LT3o
++ ~We should catch up to others now, before I say something I might regret.~ EXIT
END

