++ ~She had no way of knowing that. We're new to this area, just like you are. We were captured on our way to Amn from Baldur's Gate.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",9) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT4a
++ ~Trouble seems to find Imoen everywhere she goes. It is no surprise she'd find another way to make my life miserable.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",9) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~  EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT4a
SAY ~It was the mage you mentioned? Why would he do that, was he planing on selling you as a slave?~
