++ ~I do not really know, he cast spells on me. He said he was doing experiments.~ + LT4b
++ ~It was not just me, he kept all of us in cages. He tortured us and killed two of my companions.~ + LT4m
++ ~I... I am sorry, it is just too painful to talk about right now.~ + LT4h
++ ~It does not matter, he will not get away with it. When I find him, and I will find him, I am going to kill him.~ + LT4j
++ ~I do not want to talk about it.~ EXIT
END

