++ ~If he had a purpose, he did not tell me what is was.~ + LT4g
++ ~I have an idea but I cannot be certain until I find him.~ + LT4g
++ ~I know what he wanted, I am just not ready to talk about it. I hope you understand.~ + LT4h
++ ~Of course I know why but it is none of your business.~ + LT4i
++ ~I have no idea but I will do worse to him when I find him.~ + LT4j
++ ~It does not concern you.~ EXIT
END

