++ ~Torture is sometimes necessary, but I suppose I feel better knowing your not as sick and twisted as he is. I like being able to trust those I travel with.~ + LT4n
++ ~There are other things you are good at, things you can be proud of. Torture should not be one of them.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ LT4e
