SAY ~May I ask you something?~
++ ~Of course, what would you like to know?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",21) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT10a
++ ~I suppose, what is it?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",21) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ + LT10a
++ ~I am not in the mood, go away.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",21) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKNLovTalkTime","GLOBAL",NAV_TIME)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10a
SAY ~What brought you to Amn? Why no settle down in Baldur's Gate?~
++ ~I was asked if I would be willing to investigate a war between the thieves, and an unknown guild. I came to discover it was vampires.~ +  LT10b
++ ~I was asked to check into a problem here in Amn, and I had nothing better to do.~ +  LT10b
++ ~I hated Baldur's gate, end of story.~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10b
SAY ~You had no desire to return home, to Candlekeep?~
++ ~I did, but I was not trusted. Much less liked by them anymore.~ + LT10c
++ ~I am no longer welcome there. Knowing that, and being so close to Candlekeep, I had to get away.~ +  LT10h
++ ~They fear me now, being a bhaalspawn. They only let me live there because of Gorion.~ +  LT10c
++ ~None. After the way they treated me, I will never go there again.~ + LT10c
++ ~I doubt I can call any place home, until the prophecy is fulfilled.~ +  LT10o
++ ~I really do not want to talk about it. Now get moving.~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10c
SAY ~I heard some call you the Hero of the Sword Coast. That you saved them from Sarevok, and they treated you like that?~
++ ~That hardly matters to them. I am a Bhaalspawn too, and that is all they see when they look at me.~ +  LT10d
++ ~Not everyone, but most. They would not allow themselves to see the man, the hero. Just a Bhaalspawn.~ +  LT10d
++ ~Some did, but that matters little at this point. I suggest we get back to the others now.~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10d
SAY ~People can be such fools! It is good that you came here, You have done much to help those in need.~
++ ~That means a lot, coming from you. And yet, I cannot help feeling that coming here was a terrible mistake. Imoen would not have been taken, the others would still be alive...~ +  LT10e
++ ~I try to help, but I feel the stares of some even here. It seems I cannot escape it no matter what I do.~ +  LT10u
++ ~I appreciate that, thank you. Shall we catch up with the others?~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10e
SAY ~That not your fault, <CHARNAME>. You did the right thing, offering to help with a worthy cause.~
= ~They followed you because they believed in you.~
++ ~I know, but it is difficult to not feel responsible for their fates. It is me Irenicus was after.~ +  LT10f
++ ~I know that you are right, but that does not make it any easier to accept.~ +  LT10f
++ ~I am well aware of that. And I struggle, everyday to find a way to live with the knowledge that two of my friends were murdered, just because they were with m~ +  LT10o
++ ~I am sorry, I cannot do this right now.~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10f
SAY ~That is perfectly understandable. You care about your friends, a great deal.~
= ~Just do not let the guilt consume you.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10h
SAY ~No longer welcome, in your own home? But why?~
++ ~I cannot say for sure, but they refused to let me back in, unless I donated an expensive book.~ +  LT10i
++ ~I can only assume they knew of my heritage, and only allowed me to live there because of Gorion. I tried to go back after he died, but was refused unless I donated an expensive book.~ +  LT10l
++ ~I do not know, nor do I care. I have no desire to be there, since I am not wanted.~ +  LT10m
++ ~It no longer matters.~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10i
SAY ~A book? Why demand a book to be allowed to come home?.~
++ ~They require donations of books by visitors. The only family I have ever known is behind those walls. And yet they turned their backs on me, as if I were a stranger.~ + LT10j
++ ~They demand books to gain entry, but, after everyone treated me like a part of their family for so many years... it was no longer home.~ + LT10l
++ ~I does not matter, there is no point dwelling on what I cannot change.~ +  LT10k
++ ~It is no longer important. We should go.~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10j
SAY ~Perhaps it was. If they really cared about you, you would still be welcome there.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10k
SAY ~I agree. I know it does not make it easier, but I am here for you.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10l
SAY ~That makes sense, but it was a horrible thing to do to you. I had to be hard for you, to be turned away by those you thought loved and cared about you.~
++ ~It still is, at times. I was very happy there. Now it seems like it was all a lie.~ +  LT10j
++ ~It was at first, but I have come to accept it. It no longer bothers me.~ + LT10n
++ ~It was, but there is no point in dwelling on what I cannot change.~ + LT10k
++ ~It is no longer important. We should go.~ EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10m
SAY ~No one wants that. Just know that you are wanted here.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10n
SAY ~I am glad to hear that. I am here for you, however, should you need to talk.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10o
SAY ~Nothing I can say will make it easier on you. But know thst we are all here for you, no matter what may happen.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN LT10u
SAY ~Some people fear what they do not understand. Do not let them upset you, <CHARNAME>.~ 
= ~Those who care about you, know you are good person.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~Global("KKNLovTalk","GLOBAL",22)~ THEN BEGIN LT11
