= ~I... I love you.~
++ ~I know, I can see it in your eyes. And, I love you too.~ + LT11d
++ ~Love? I care for you, but we need to slow down a bit.~ + LT11g
++ ~Love? I just wanted to sleep with you, nothing more.~ + LT11i
END

IF ~~ THEN LT11d 
