++ ~That is a wonderful idea.~ + LT11e
++ ~I prefer my own. Meet me there?~ + LT11f
++ ~It is too soon for that, I am sorry.~ + LT11g
++ ~I changed my mind, I think we should end this.~ + LT11h
END

