IF ~Global("KKNFTalk","GLOBAL",2)~ THEN BEGIN FT1
SAY ~Tell me of this mage you spoke of, <CHARNAME>. I admit to being curious.~
++ ~His name is Irenicus. He mentioned something about unlocking my power, as if that was an excuse for torturing me. He also killed two of my companions.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNFTalk","GLOBAL",3) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKFemaleTalkTime","GLOBAL",1800)~  + FT1a
++ ~His name is Irenicus and he is quite powerful. From the things I saw in the dungeon he held me in, he is not above using torture to get what he wants. He also murdered two of my companions.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNFTalk","GLOBAL",3) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKFemaleTalkTime","GLOBAL",1800)~  + FT1a
++ ~I would really rather not talk about it right now, I am sorry.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNFTalk","GLOBAL",3) RealSetGlobalTimer("KKFemaleTalkTime","GLOBAL",1800)~ + FT1t
