END

IF ~~ THEN KKNSoul2c
SAY ~I will protect you, I promise you. I cannot, will not let you die.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNSoul2d
SAY ~For you, I would give my life to protect her. But do not tell me not to worry, we are in this together.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

IF ~~ THEN KKNSoul2e
SAY ~No, you are not. I will make sure that you are, however, or did trying. I cannot live without you.~
IF ~~ THEN EXIT 
END

